  "provenance": "Generic Chinese/English warehouse-logistics and building-drawing vocabulary: six common warehouse equipment types and common industry terms. No block, layer or text name taken from any supplied drawing. Changes require a new lexicon version and a tuning-ledger entry. v1.1 adds the international layer-standard words 'grid' (AIA/NCS S-GRID, A-GRID) and 'cols' (A-COLS, S-COLS). v1.2 adds the generic structural-drawing words '梁' (beam) and '钢平台' (steel platform) to view_role_terms.structural. v1.3 adds generic industry product words: conveyor generic names ('辊道机', '辊筒机', '皮带机', '滚筒线', '辊道线', '输送带'), and other_known_equipment classes VERTICAL_LIFT_MODULE, PICK_STATION, PALLETIZER, PALLET_DISPENSER, WRAPPER plus the spelling variants '移栽机'/'顶升移栽' and 'rgv'; other_known_equipment is now used by the text rule (reported as other equipment with its name). v1.4 adds zone_suffixes: generic endings of area names (a text ending in one names an area, not one machine). v1.5 adds unit-note phrasings '以米计', '以米为单位', '单位：米', '单位:米', '以毫米计', '以毫米为单位' and building_outline_layers (建筑物, 构筑物, 房屋, building, bldg) and elevation_legend_terms (indoor: 室内; ground: 室外, 场地, 地面, 道路, 设计地坪). Also v1.5: non_building_linework_layers (roads, greenery, centre lines, dimensions, frames, coordinate leaders, titles) and non_building_name_endings (路, 街, 河, 绿化, 广场).",
